    "description": "Calculate e-commerce shipping costs with parcel rates, packaging, handling and shipping charged to buyers. Compare free, flat-rate and paid shipping.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate e-commerce shipping costs with parcel rates, packaging, handling and shipping charged to buyers. Compare free, flat-rate and paid shipping.",
